flowchart TD
    Start{{Document received}}
    Extract[Extract fields]
    Valid{Fields valid?}
    Save[Save record]
    End{{Record stored}}
    Correct[Correct fields]
    subgraph Reference[Reference material]
        Schema[Field schema]
        Dictionary[Terminology dictionary]
    end
    Start --> Extract
    Schema --> Extract
    Dictionary --> Extract
    Extract --> Valid
    Valid -->|Yes| Save
    Valid -->|No| Correct
    Correct -->|Retry| Extract
    Save --> End

